  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b4891b34-091e-5be1-b350-461bfa4651e5",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -570,
        -230
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 1005,
        "content": "## Send daily building permit leads from Apify to Google Sheets and Gmail\n\nGet a fresh list of solar, roofing, pool, remodel and ADU projects permitted in 12 US cities every morning. Built for contractors, installers, suppliers and home-services marketers who want leads from official open data.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. A schedule trigger runs every day at 7:00.\n2. **CONFIG** holds the cities, keywords, minimum project value and digest email.\n3. The *US Building Permits* Apify Actor returns permits from official city open-data portals.\n4. Permits already seen in earlier runs are skipped.\n5. New permits are appended to Google Sheets and emailed as an HTML digest sorted by project value.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Create an Apify account and copy your API token. In n8n add a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`, and select it in *Get permits (Apify)*.\n2. Create a Google Sheet with a `Permits` tab and the headers listed in the sheet node. Paste its ID into *Append to Google Sheets*.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail.\n4. Edit **CONFIG** and click **Test workflow**, then activate.\n\n### Requirements\n\nAn Apify account ([US Building Permits Actor](https://apify.com/batreek/us-building-permits)), Google Sheets and Gmail.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange cities, keywords or `minValuation` in CONFIG. Swap Gmail for Slack or Telegram to get alerts in chat. Cost is about $1.50 per 1,000 permits on Apify.\n\n**Disclosure:** the Apify Actor used here was built and is published by the author of this template (EdenWorks). You pay Apify's usage price when it runs and the author earns part of that fee. Apify's free plan credits cover light use."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ba3415e5-c122-507a-bc6f-b15778fdbd26",
      "name": "Section 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -30,
        -110
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## 1. Schedule and settings\nRuns daily. Edit CONFIG only."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
